A few things don't match how we actually operate, so I need some corrections before this is ready:

1. **`responseMode`** — those values (`Immediate`, `Urgent`, etc.) aren't right for us. Every acknowledgement we draft has to go through human review before it goes to the customer; we never send automatically. So `responseMode` should always come back as `Draft`, regardless of severity.

2. **`caseKey`** — I need that to simply carry the `correlationId` through unchanged. Downstream systems look it up by that exact value. Adding the severity suffix breaks the correlation.

3. **Sev4** — we don't have a Sev4 tier. The three buckets are Sev1, Sev2, and Sev3. Anything that doesn't hit the Sev1 or Sev2 criteria should fall to Sev3.

